WindowHeight [SimTalk]
Sets the height in pixels with which Plant Simulation opens the display window of the HtmlReport
designated by <Path>.
Syntax
<Path>.WindowHeight:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
Example
MyHtmlReport.WindowHeight := 600 // pixels
