Dialog
Dialog [object]
Use the object Dialog for designing a dialog box for an object which is similar to the built-in dialog boxes.
Image
Description
With the object Dialog you can:
• Provide the user with a simple user interface for complex simulation models other users work with. This
way you can ask the user to type in information which Plant Simulation needs to carry out a task.
